# DataAgent marketing site - Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Cloudflare Pages automatically serves extensionless URLs by appending
# .html (/about -> about.html), so most pages need no rule. These entries
# are the mappings where no same-named file exists.
#
# 200 = REWRITE, not a redirect: the visitor keeps the clean URL (/pricing)
# and the host serves /billing.html. A 301/302 would put the .html in the
# address bar and change the canonical URL of the page.

/pricing  /billing.html  200
/404      /404.html      200
